background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2114755_1786213805_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2114755_1786213805_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>里瓦斯、埃斯皮破门，最终皇马2-1击败费伦茨瓦罗斯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-09/match2101207date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">45分钟友谊赛-巴萨1-0森林 拉菲点射费尔明造点 两队各一次中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2101207_1786219421_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2101207_1786219421_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2101207_1786219421_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>费尔明造点，拉菲尼亚点射破门，巴萨1-0击败诺丁汉森林。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-09/match2101206date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">45分钟循环赛-巴萨0-1不敌乌迪内斯无缘冠军 巴约挑射绝杀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2101206_1786223289_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2101206_1786223289_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260809/zhanbao_image_2101206_1786223289_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>巴约挑射绝杀，乌迪内斯1-0战胜巴萨，2战全胜夺得冠军；巴萨1胜1负拿到第二，诺丁汉森林2战全负垫底。</p><p><strong>【R.I.P.梅西父亲去世】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a770072967f8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">R.I.P.🙏梅西父亲豪尔赫·梅西去世，享年68岁</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608081810022766.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608081810022766_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608081810022766_720.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷媒体Infobae报道，梅西父亲豪尔赫·梅西去世，享年68岁。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a773d1c570a0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">路透社：梅西家人证实梅西父亲昨晚离世，家人陪伴走完最后时光</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a773e895e330native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">号角报：梅西已启程飞回罗萨里奥送别去世的父亲，此前他身在美国</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082236436707.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082236436707_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082236436707_720.jpg"> </div><p>据阿根廷媒体《号角报》消息，梅西已经启程飞往罗萨里奥，与去世的父亲作最后的告别。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a7748f56fe29native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿足协官方：本周末所有足球赛事赛前，为梅西父亲默哀一分钟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.26" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260808/202608082329272422.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.26" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.26" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260808/202608082329272422.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260808/202608082329272422.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷足协在官网发布公告，在本周末所有足球赛事赛前为梅西父亲默哀一分钟。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a774a1e84011native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨官方：对豪尔赫·梅西逝世表示沉痛哀悼，向梅西家族致以慰问</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082324169399_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082324169399_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082324169399_720.jpg"> </div><p>梅西父亲豪尔赫·梅西今日离世，享年68岁，巴萨官方发布声明哀悼离世的梅西父亲。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-08/6a77480ec4041native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马官方：对豪尔赫·梅西的逝世表示深切哀悼，谨向梅西致以慰问</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.17" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260808/202608082315341463.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.17" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图